e about the betas and more pass-through to customers, I guess.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/05/30/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q2-2018-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"BMO 2018 Q2","e":"bmo","d":"2018-05-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Darryl White","x":"The restructuring charge we took this quarter accelerates the ongoing bankwide initiative to transform how we work, how we compete, and how we create value for our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/05/30/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q2-2018-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"BMO 2018 Q2","e":"bmo","d":"2018-05-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas Flynn","x":"As shown on Slide 24, adjusting items this quarter include a restructuring charge of $192 million after tax, primarily for severance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/05/30/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q2-2018-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"BMO 2018 Q3","e":"bmo","d":"2018-08-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Darryl White","x":"On efficiency, another priority we've been focused on, we're making steady progress through the combination of cost reduction and revenue acceleration initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/29/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q3-2018-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"BMO 2018 Q3","e":"bmo","d":"2018-08-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Flynn","x":"On the expense side, we had some benefit from restructuring, but we also had a real estate gain in the number that helped on the expense side.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/29/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q3-2018-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"BMO 2019 Q2","e":"bmo","d":"2019-05-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Darryl White","x":"Today, we announced strong performance for the second quarter with earnings of CA$1.5 billion and earnings per share of CA$2.30, an increase of 5% over last year, and this is after absorbing a severance cost in our Capital Markets pillar.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/29/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BMO 2019 Q2","e":"bmo","d":"2019-05-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Darryl White","x":"Our results this quarter include a severance cost, which we absorbed in our Capital Markets group, of CA$120 million pre-tax, negatively impacting our adjusted earnings by CA$0.14 per share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/29/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BMO 2019 Q3","e":"bmo","d":"2019-08-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Patrick Cronin","x":"So, exacerbated probably mildly by some of the recent tariff issues.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/27/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BMO 2019 Q3","e":"bmo","d":"2019-08-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Darryl White","x":"On a year-to-date basis, earnings per share are up 5% or 7%, excluding the impact of the severance charge in Capital Markets last quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/27/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BMO 2019 Q3","e":"bmo","d":"2019-08-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Darryl White","x":"And in that context, we'll make our decisions with how aggressive we'll be with respect to restructuring, I would say, as we launch into the first couple of quarters of 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/27/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BMO 2019 Q4","e":"bmo","d":"2019-12-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Darryl White","x":"Now let me turn to the restructuring charge we announced today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/03/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BMO 2019 Q4","e":"bmo","d":"2019-12-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Darryl White","x":"We ended the year with an efficiency ratio of 61.4% even after absorbing the severance expense in Capital Markets with increasing momentum into the back half of the year as evidenced by our efficiency ratios of 59.9% and 60% in the last two quarters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/03/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BMO 2020 Q1","e":"bmo","d":"2020-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Darryl White","x":"The business continues to strengthen and streamline with targeted investments in key competitive growth areas.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/25/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BMO 2020 Q1","e":"bmo","d":"2020-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas E. Flynn","x":"We are on track to deliver the expense savings from our Q4 restructuring charge in line with prior guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/25/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BMO 2020 Q2","e":"bmo","d":"2020-05-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas E. Flynn","x":"Expenses were down 15% from last year due to the impact primarily of a severance in the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/27/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"BMO 2021 Q2","e":"bmo","d":"2021-05-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David R. Casper","x":"And there is product delays and there is price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"BMO 2021 Q3","e":"bmo","d":"2021-08-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Tayfun Tuzun","x":"Adjusting items this quarter include expenses of CAD18 million after-tax from the impact of divestitures, offset by a partial reversal of restructuring charges recorded in the fourth quarter of 2019 related to severance of CAD18 million after-tax.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/24/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"BMO 2021 Q3","e":"bmo","d":"2021-08-24","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Meny Grauman","x":"And just a clarification in terms of reiterating the outlook for positive operating leverage, but can that change on a quarter-to-quarter basis?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/24/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"BMO 2026 Q2","e":"bmo","d":"2026-05-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Piyush Agrawal","x":"At the same time, expansionary fiscal policies and AI investment present important support for economic growth as we progress through the rest of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/29/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BMO 2026 Q2","e":"bmo","d":"2026-05-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rahul Nalgirkar","x":"And in the next few quarters, we do expect these levels to remain higher as we pass through this.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/29/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BMO 2026 Q2","e":"bmo","d":"2026-05-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rahul Nalgirkar","x":"Corporate Services net loss of $86 million improved sequentially as prior quarter was impacted by severance charges and seasonally high expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/29/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BMO 2026 Q2","e":"bmo","d":"2026-05-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Darryl White","x":"Recent federal measures such as setting firm deadlines for project reviews and approvals within 1 year, streamlining consultations, establishing special economic zones and trade corridors nationally and simplifying regulatory reporting are positive, and they're a good start.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/29/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BMO 2026 Q2","e":"bmo","d":"2026-05-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Rahul Nalgirkar","x":"We maintain our outlook for the full year of mid-single-digit core expense growth and delivered positive operating leverage for the remainder of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/29/bank-of-montreal-bmo-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BMO 2026 Q3","e":"bmo","d":"2026-08-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Darryl White","x":"…think this really has much impact whatsoever on the U.S. economy, which is mostly geared towards its own drivers, and that includes the downstream effect, of course, from the AI trade and the CapEx cycle, which is real, and we participate in that as many do in various parts of that ecosystem.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/01/bmo-bmo-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BMO 2026 Q3","e":"bmo","d":"2026-08-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Ebrahim Poonawala","x":"And on the U.S. side, how much of lending do you think can get influenced or impacted by the AI CapEx cycle, either direct or second round effects?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/01/bmo-bmo-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BMO 2026 Q3","e":"bmo","d":"2026-08-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Piyush Agrawal","x":"Energy-driven inflation has created near-term volatility and this weekend's announcement of additional tariffs present downside risks.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/01/bmo-bmo-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BMO 2026 Q3","e":"bmo","d":"2026-08-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Piyush Agrawal","x":"At the same time, the recent tariff announcement is an important development, and we are watching the potential second order effects on Canadian growth, employment and business inves